Terakhir, tutup siklus pembelajaran.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:24.760
Tata kelola bukanlah dokumen statis

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.200
melainkan dialog berkelanjutan

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:27.900
antara analis manusia dan agen AE.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:29.440
Manusia menyesuaikan,

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:30.480
kopilot mengeksekusi,

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.460
manusia meverifikasi,

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:32.260
